    overview: `Deposit characteristics (grade, tonnage, classification) are documented in geological surveys and feasibility studies. Resource and reserve estimates follow international standards (JORC, NI 43-101) where available; Soviet-era data have been reinterpreted in some cases. Timeline entries reference deposit data for major projects: Mes Aynak (12.5M t copper), Hajigak (2.2B t iron), Ghazni lithium (215M t LCE). Links to data reports and resource estimates. Figures aligned with $30T+ endowment.`,
